BaseCollector Responsibilities

Shared:
✓ Run pipeline
✓ Read company universe
✓ Batch management
✓ Retry logic
✓ Failure handling
✓ Dataset assembly
✓ Export logic

Child collectors provide:
✓ API endpoint details
✓ Request construction
✓ Response parsing
✓ Normalization mapping

Required Attributes of child collectorswill define
SOURCE_NAME
BASE_URL
BATCH_SIZE
MAX_RETRIES
OUTPUT_COLUMNS

Required Abstract Methods
build_request()
fetch_batch()
parse_response()
normalize_record()

